WEBVTT

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:14.263
The Covenant has captured
a high-priority package.

00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:18.267
Spartans, it's your job
to infiltrate enemy space and retrieve it.

00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:20.519
Mission window: 10 minutes.

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:23.439
The target is equipped
with a location beacon...

00:00:23.606 --> 00:00:27.693
...but you'll have to get close to read it.
It's a weak signal with a short radius.

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:31.030
A stellar magnetic field
is preventing the Covenant fleet...

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:32.781
...from making a Slipspace jump.

00:00:32.949 --> 00:00:35.034
You'll be flying in
with EVA booster frames.

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:38.328
When you reach the Covenant fleet,
find the signal, find the ship...

00:00:38.496 --> 00:00:40.664
...find a way in and grab that target.

00:00:40.832 --> 00:00:44.543
The Covenant doesn't appear to realize
the full value of what they've acquired.

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:47.046
And that's the way we wanna keep it.

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:50.674
Complete the extraction
before they figure out what they've got.

00:00:50.842 --> 00:00:53.635
All right, Spartans, you have your orders.
Good luck.

00:00:53.803 --> 00:00:55.387
Yes, sir.

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:59.516
- Captain.
- What is it, Master Chief?

00:00:59.684 --> 00:01:01.310
What happens if we run out of time?

00:01:02.145 --> 00:01:04.938
Our only choice will be
to annihilate the Covenant fleet...

00:01:05.106 --> 00:01:07.441
...the package and your entire team.

00:01:07.609 --> 00:01:09.735
Is that clear enough?

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:11.236
I understand.

00:01:14.991 --> 00:01:18.243
Spartan team, the moment
we break stealth...

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:20.579
...commence operation.

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:26.418
Five, four, three, two, one.

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:29.713
Disable cloak. Booster frame.

00:01:29.881 --> 00:01:31.173
Launch.

00:01:47.524 --> 00:01:50.150
Incoming. Optimize mobility.

00:01:55.448 --> 00:01:57.366
Plasma rounds.

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:13.132
Scanning device is activated.

00:02:19.722 --> 00:02:20.889
I've got a reading.

00:02:21.057 --> 00:02:22.933
- Are you sure?
- No question.

00:02:23.101 --> 00:02:25.394
Back me up, I'm going in.

00:02:32.152 --> 00:02:33.235
Their shields are down.

00:02:33.403 --> 00:02:35.571
The signal's coming from that cruiser.

00:02:35.738 --> 00:02:37.531
Hang on, Solomon, wait for the Chief.

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:40.868
No time. I'll take my chances.

00:02:42.829 --> 00:02:46.081
All right, if we're gonna do this,
let's make it fast.

00:02:55.091 --> 00:02:57.843
Positive read from the
first scan. Something's off.

00:02:59.888 --> 00:03:01.597
Hurry, Solomon.

00:03:05.226 --> 00:03:06.768
Gotcha.

00:03:09.022 --> 00:03:10.606
No.

00:03:10.773 --> 00:03:13.025
- Kelly, it's a trap.
- No.

00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:24.369
They took the bait.
Three have perished.

00:03:24.537 --> 00:03:27.372
The rest are only a matter of time.

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:30.209
We must always show
our superior strength.

00:03:30.376 --> 00:03:34.379
Anything less
and they will exploit our weakness.

00:03:34.547 --> 00:03:38.383
Weakness. You have faced
these lowly creatures in battle...

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:40.552
...while your battalion perished.

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:43.222
That tells me only one thing.

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:46.391
You have not the heart
to die with honor.

00:03:46.559 --> 00:03:48.894
Commander, two survivors detected.

00:03:51.981 --> 00:03:54.399
- Solomon.
- Kelly, look.

00:03:55.109 --> 00:03:56.652
I'm getting multiple readings.

00:03:56.819 --> 00:03:59.321
They're decoys.
They know what we came for.

00:03:59.489 --> 00:04:01.448
How do we find the real signal?

00:04:01.616 --> 00:04:03.033
They've already told us.

00:04:03.409 --> 00:04:05.702
What we want is in the heart
of this fleet.

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:07.788
The flagship.

00:04:09.749 --> 00:04:11.833
Syrup formation, 2 o'clock.

00:04:12.335 --> 00:04:14.670
Ignore them. Stay on target.

00:04:25.431 --> 00:04:27.557
Four enemies approaching.

00:04:28.101 --> 00:04:30.060
They know.

00:04:30.228 --> 00:04:33.188
Will you run away once more?

00:04:33.356 --> 00:04:36.066
They will be here. I shall face them.

00:04:36.234 --> 00:04:38.610
You overestimate them.

00:04:38.778 --> 00:04:41.071
They cannot touch this ship.

00:04:42.365 --> 00:04:45.117
I pray that you are right.

00:04:50.164 --> 00:04:51.581
Tight formation, now.

00:04:51.749 --> 00:04:54.001
Concentrate Gauss cannons
on a single point.

00:04:54.168 --> 00:04:55.294
- Roger.
- Roger.

00:04:55.461 --> 00:04:57.296
Shields at maximum charge.

00:04:59.882 --> 00:05:01.300
They're still with us.

00:05:03.469 --> 00:05:06.513
- I'm hit.
- I'll hold them back.

00:05:11.728 --> 00:05:12.769
I'm losing it.

00:05:14.647 --> 00:05:16.315
Arthur!

00:05:25.033 --> 00:05:27.784
You've gotta eject. I got your six.

00:05:31.539 --> 00:05:34.291
- You secure?
- Give me the turret.

00:05:34.584 --> 00:05:36.001
Now I got your six.

00:05:36.169 --> 00:05:38.128
Let's get on with it.

00:05:41.841 --> 00:05:44.676
Gauss cannon charge, 85 percent.

00:05:49.682 --> 00:05:51.016
They're advancing position.

00:05:51.642 --> 00:05:53.018
Ninety-one percent.

00:05:57.023 --> 00:05:58.523
There it is.

00:06:03.071 --> 00:06:04.780
Launch all missiles.

00:06:04.947 --> 00:06:07.532
Gauss cannon, fire.

00:06:12.622 --> 00:06:14.164
This thing's toast.

00:06:14.332 --> 00:06:16.541
Then let them have it.

00:06:35.144 --> 00:06:36.978
Looks like this is the right ship.

00:06:37.146 --> 00:06:40.023
- We got three minutes.
- Let's sprint this.

00:06:40.191 --> 00:06:41.566
Don't fall behind.

00:06:41.734 --> 00:06:43.402
- Copy that.
- Copy that.

00:06:48.574 --> 00:06:49.866
Go.

00:07:23.443 --> 00:07:25.652
Three units passing Sector 25.

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:28.530
Stop them. Seal all hatches.

00:07:30.575 --> 00:07:32.534
- Fred.
- I got it.

00:08:02.148 --> 00:08:05.400
- The enemy is advancing.
- No.

00:08:05.568 --> 00:08:06.818
Where is the major?

00:08:21.834 --> 00:08:23.668
Go. I got this.

00:08:25.546 --> 00:08:30.091
All right, the great journey ends here.

00:08:30.259 --> 00:08:32.219
- Fred.
- Focus on the mission.

00:08:32.386 --> 00:08:33.803
We get the target.

00:08:33.971 --> 00:08:35.805
Commander, they're getting closer.

00:08:35.973 --> 00:08:37.849
Getting closer, are they?

00:08:38.017 --> 00:08:39.809
Not for long.

00:08:46.567 --> 00:08:48.109
Chief.

00:08:54.534 --> 00:08:55.825
Break off the entire block.

00:08:55.993 --> 00:08:58.370
But, commander, our brothers have...

00:08:58.538 --> 00:08:59.704
Silence.

00:08:59.872 --> 00:09:03.208
Let them die with honor.

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:18.974
Chief.

00:09:21.018 --> 00:09:22.227
Go get her.

00:09:23.563 --> 00:09:25.230
Kelly.

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:32.070
Kelly.

00:10:17.199 --> 00:10:19.075
Dr. Halsey.

00:10:22.455 --> 00:10:24.039
John.

00:10:24.206 --> 00:10:27.292
- It's you?
- Yes. I'm here to take you back.

00:10:28.544 --> 00:10:32.380
- Sleep well, doctor?
- No thanks to their driving, yes.

00:10:33.007 --> 00:10:35.133
You seem to be in one piece.

00:10:35.301 --> 00:10:37.719
Maybe your luck has rubbed off on me.

00:10:37.887 --> 00:10:39.596
We make our own luck...

00:10:39.764 --> 00:10:41.598
...but I'll always be there
when you need me.

00:10:41.766 --> 00:10:44.643
Don't make a girl a promise
if you know you can't keep it.

00:10:45.186 --> 00:10:49.022
- Still, thank you.
- Sure.

00:10:49.398 --> 00:10:51.399
- Dr. Halsey...
- It's not a proper rescue...

00:10:51.567 --> 00:10:53.443
...until you get us out of here, right?

00:10:53.986 --> 00:10:57.489
Agreed. We need to move fast.

00:11:38.656 --> 00:11:39.864
John, wait.

00:11:40.032 --> 00:11:42.867
- We're out of time.
- What? No.

00:11:43.035 --> 00:11:44.953
We're clear
of the magnetic interference.

00:11:45.121 --> 00:11:47.664
Stand by for Slipspace jump.

00:11:47.832 --> 00:11:50.250
They're trapped in Delta section.

00:11:50.418 --> 00:11:52.168
Separate the moment we jump.

00:11:52.336 --> 00:11:53.837
But what of the major
and his group?

00:11:54.004 --> 00:11:55.630
No matter.

00:11:55.798 --> 00:11:57.757
He is already shamed.

00:11:57.925 --> 00:12:03.221
His only path now is death or arbiter.

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:07.392
I had him.

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:11.479
Commander, you fool.

00:12:11.856 --> 00:12:15.400
A thousand hells await you!

00:12:19.947 --> 00:12:22.198
They're scuttling the ship.

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:24.075
And us with it.

00:12:24.243 --> 00:12:26.703
But we make our own luck,
remember?

00:12:31.959 --> 00:12:33.668
What are you suggesting?

00:12:33.836 --> 00:12:36.171
What else? We improvise.

00:12:47.516 --> 00:12:49.350
Doctor, we've got company.

00:12:49.935 --> 00:12:52.103
Can't you do anything?

00:12:54.356 --> 00:12:55.940
Can't this bucket go any faster?

00:13:00.613 --> 00:13:01.988
What's happening?

00:13:02.156 --> 00:13:04.282
Cutting it a little close, aren't we?

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:05.950
Fred.

00:13:06.118 --> 00:13:07.786
Doctor, are you all right?

00:13:07.953 --> 00:13:09.287
Yes, I'm fine.

00:13:09.455 --> 00:13:12.582
These Covenant rigs fly like rocks.
It took us a bit to get rolling.

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:14.334
Incoming.

00:13:15.586 --> 00:13:19.297
- What?
- Welcome back, Spartans.

00:13:32.019 --> 00:13:35.146
You really are lucky. You know that.

00:13:35.314 --> 00:13:37.315
Not lucky enough.

00:13:37.483 --> 00:13:39.901
We lost two Spartans today.

00:13:40.069 --> 00:13:42.153
Solomon and Arthur.

00:13:42.321 --> 00:13:46.574
And that Elite we encountered,
he was strong.

00:13:46.867 --> 00:13:49.494
I have to be stronger.

00:13:49.703 --> 00:13:52.372
We all have to be stronger.

00:13:53.582 --> 00:13:56.835
Something tells me
this is just the beginning.
